Module LAPT_1RB1LA_0LA0RC_0LD1RB_1RC1LD.
(** * LAPT_1RB1LA_0LA0RC_0LD1RB_1RC1LD: TRANSITION-LEVEL board for machine 1RB1LA_0LA0RC_0LD1RB_1RC1LD, boarded by CERTIFICATE.

