Theorem nonhalt_1RB1LA_0LA1RC_0LA1RD_0RB0LC : NonHalt tm_1RB1LA_0LA1RC_0LA1RD_0RB0LC.
Proof. apply never_qh_tr_nonhalt, nqhtr_1RB1LA_0LA1RC_0LA1RD_0RB0LC. Qed.

