    apply (fire_via_ovf_lift tm Cc Hi (StC, S0)).
    intros p1 j1 E1. apply (fire_lift_of_csteps tm Cc).
    apply (fireo_1RB1LA_0LA1RC_0LD0RB_1RA1LD [SWinR 2; SCycL 2 0; SWin 6; SCycR 2; SWin 1] (StC, S0) ltac:(vm_compute; reflexivity)
