    family's own overflow decomposition names the word. *)
Lemma gxi_1RB1LA_0LA1RC_0LD0RB_1RB1LD : forall j, Cin (fill (pow2 j)) = cden [] [] j BE0_1RB1LA_0LA1RC_0LD0RB_1RB1LD.
