Module LAPT_1RB1LA_0LA1RC_0LD0RB____0RB.
(** * LAPT_1RB1LA_0LA1RC_0LD0RB____0RB: TRANSITION-LEVEL board for machine 1RB1LA_0LA1RC_0LD0RB_---0RB, boarded by CERTIFICATE.

    Auto-emitted by tools/counters/emit_lapcert.py (UNTRUSTED emitter; the Coq
    kernel re-runs the checker on every line below).  Left-growth binary
